ectable": {"mode": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SheetSage2AudioToABC"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "links": [113], "label": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "type": "AUDIO_ENCODER", "localized_name": "AUDIO_ENCODER"}], "size": [420, 80], "pos": [70.08901977539062, -311.4463195800781], "widgets_values": ["sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio_encoder_name"}, "name": "audio_encoder_name", "label": "audio_encoder_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "audio_encoder_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "AudioEncoderLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors", "directory": "audio_encoders", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/audio_encoders/sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.37.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"audio_encoder_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "AudioEncoderLoader"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [116], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [391.0037536621094, 589.388427734375], "pos": [258.8302001953125, -119.33551025390625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 115, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 59, "type": "PreviewAny", "title": "ABC记谱", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# YuE2：音乐翻唱\n\n用 YuE2 对一首已有歌曲进行重新创作。\n\n本工作流先用 **SheetSage2** 把参考音频转写成可编辑的 ABC 记谱旋律，再用 YuE2 依据新的**风格描述**与**歌词**重新生成歌曲。\n\n## 素材准备\n\n- [yue2_reference_song.flac](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/yue2_reference_song.flac)\n\n## 模型下载\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**audio_encoders**\n\n- [sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/audio_encoders/sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors)\n\n\n## 模型存放位置\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 checkpoints/\n│   │   └── yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 audio_encoders/\n│       └── sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors\n```\n\n## 使用方法\n\n[Subgraph](https://docs.comfy.org/interface/features/subgraph)\n\n1. 在 **Audio** 中加载一首参考歌曲。\n2. 在 **Style** 中描述你想要的新音乐方向。\n3. 在 **Lyrics** 中填入要唱的歌词。\n4. 运行工作流，生成新的翻唱版本。\n\n参考音频提供旋律，YuE2 则依据你的风格描述与歌词，重新演绎并重新编曲。\n\n## 风格描述怎么写\n\n清楚描述目标音乐风格。\n\n可以包含的要素：\n\n- **曲风**：爵士、流行、摇滚、民谣、电子\n- **人声**：温暖男声、富有表现力的女声、柔和嗓音\n- **语言**：中文、英文、日文等\n- **速度**：90 BPM、舒缓、轻快\n- **乐器**：钢琴、吉他、贝斯、鼓、弦乐、合成器\n- **氛围**：私密、活力、怀旧、电影感\n\n示例：\n\n> 中文, 温暖治愈的民谣, 温柔女声, 82 BPM, 木吉他, 细腻弦乐, 深夜房间里的私密氛围\n\n## 歌词怎么写\n\n使用如下段落标记：\n\n    [Verse]\n    街灯在路面轻轻晃动\n    午夜呼吸缓慢而轻柔\n\n    [Chorus]\n    陪我到天亮\n    让城市渐渐远去\n\n可用标记：\n\n`[Verse]` · `[Chorus]` · `[Bridge]` · `[Outro]`\n\n想让旋律贴合得更好时，新歌词的句式与字数尽量贴近原曲。\n\n## 翻唱是怎么工作的\n\n本工作流并不直接把参考音频作为 YuE2 的条件输入，而是：\n\n    参考音频\n        ↓\n    SheetSage2\n        ↓\n    旋律 ABC 记谱\n        ↓\n    YuE2 + 风格描述 + 歌词\n        ↓\n    新的翻唱音频\n\nSheetSage2 会把原始录音转写成符号化的旋律表示，YuE2 再以这段旋律作为新翻唱的音乐骨架。\n\n## 使用技巧\n\n- **风格描述**请聚焦于目标听感，而非原曲听感。\n- 多数翻唱任务使用**纯旋律**规划即可。\n- 只改风格描述，就能在保留旋律的同时得到差异很大的编曲。\n- 歌词可以改，但句式与字数接近原曲时，通常更贴合原有旋律。\n- 想做简单的风格迁移测试时，保留原歌词、只改风格描述即可。\n- 想做更彻底的重构时，同时改动风格描述与歌词。\n\n## 延伸阅读\n\n- [YuE2 翻唱指南](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/docs/covers.md)\n- [YuE2 音乐技能](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/SKILL.md)\n- [生成与翻唱参考](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/references/generation-and-covers.md)\n\n## 问题反馈\n\n注意：请先更新 ComfyUI（[升级指南](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)）并准备好所需模型。桌面版／云端版本跟随稳定版发布，因此部分仅在开发版支持的模型可能还无法获取。\n\n- 无法运行／运行报错：[ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- 界面／前端问题：[ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- 工作流问题：[workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [618.6738891601562, 1408.716552734375], "pos": [-1901.075439453125, -663.6843872070312], "id": 64, "properties": {}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [119], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [472.8548278808594, 637.1286010742188], "pos": [-498.6197509765625, -161.06747436523438], "widgets_values": ["[Verse] \n春眠不觉晓 , 处处闻啼鸟\n[Chorus] \n夜来风雨声 ,花落知多少"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "歌词", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "seed", "links": [111, 112], "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "size": [260.64080810546875, 96.07122802734375], "pos": [-846.8052368164062, 71.25183868408203], "widgets_values": [88, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 56, "type": "SeedNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"seed": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedNode"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [118], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [476.49755859375, 291.0684509277344], "pos": [-507.1197204589844, -508.3418273925781], "widgets_values": ["Chinese Mandarin, Chinese traditional style, Guofeng, warm resonant male voice, pipa and guzheng plucks, soft bamboo flute, sustained strings pad, slow unhurried phrasing, sparse 